    },
    "Athlete" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a skill (ability) the player builds, shown next to a pictogram and used as a playful job-like title. The skill: Physical stamina — long shifts on your feet, heavy work, and all weathers, indoors or out.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
