          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flight school and its licence are the gate; years of experience open each rung." : {
      "comment" : "Airline pilot note, point 1: what the game does about it",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La scuola di volo e il suo brevetto sono la soglia d’ingresso; gli anni di esperienza aprono ogni livello."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Floor, bars, vault, beam. Years of precision, body control, and strength work build the toolkit of an Olympic-stream athlete." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boden, Barren, Sprung, Schwebebalken. Jahre voller Präzision, Körperbeherrschung und Krafttraining formen das Rüstzeug eines Athleten auf olympischem Kurs."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Corpo libero, parallele, volteggio, trave. Anni di precisione, controllo del corpo e lavoro sulla forza costruiscono il bagaglio di chi punta alle Olimpiadi."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вільні вправи, бруси, опорний стрибок, колода. Роки точності, контролю тіла й силових тренувань формують арсенал спортсмена олімпійського рівня."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folkhögskola" : {
      "comment" : "School term: open-access college tier (Sweden).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folkhögskola"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folkhögskola"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "国民高等学校"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folkhögskola"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a job, you'll see how many years you've been there and your chance of being promoted. Tap each ⓘ to learn more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei einem Job siehst du, wie viele Jahre du schon dort bist, und deine Beförderungschance. Tippe auf jedes ⓘ, um mehr zu erfahren."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per un lavoro vedrai da quanti anni lo fai e la tua probabilità di promozione. Tocca ogni ⓘ per saperne di più."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a job, you'll see how many years you've been there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei einem Job siehst du, wie viele Jahre du schon dort bist."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per un lavoro vedrai da quanti anni lo fai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a top seat, a public name counts for more than for an ordinary job." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per un posto al vertice, essere noti al pubblico conta più che per un lavoro comune."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For the student who led something real — a campaign, a charity, a change at school." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für Schüler, die etwas Echtes geleitet haben – eine Kampagne, eine Spendenaktion, eine Veränderung an der Schule."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per chi ha guidato qualcosa di concreto — una campagna, un’iniziativa benefica, un cambiamento a scuola."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本当に何かを率いた生徒のための賞です。たとえば、キャンペーンやチャリティー、学校を変える取り組みなどです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для того, хто очолив щось справжнє — кампанію, благодійну справу, зміни в школі."
          }
        }
      }
    },
