          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grow food and care for plants and animals." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baue Essen an und kümmere dich um Pflanzen und Tiere."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coltiva il cibo e prenditi cura di piante e animali."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вирощуй їжу та доглядай за рослинами й тваринами."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grow them with Activities, and later with events, courses and projects. Tap a skill's ⓘ to see where it helps most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baue sie mit Aktivitäten aus, später mit Events, Kursen und Projekten. Tippe auf das ⓘ einer Fähigkeit, um zu sehen, wo sie am meisten hilft."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Falle crescere con le Attività e, più avanti, con eventi, corsi e progetti. Tocca ⓘ accanto a una competenza per vedere dove aiuta di più."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Growing" : {
      "comment" : "How an industry is doing this year: expanding. Next to Booming, Steady, Slowing, Slump.",
