            "value" : "Інвестиційний раунд для «%@» не відбувся"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It admits by grades, skills and awards — start building them now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ammette in base a voti, competenze e premi — inizia a costruirli adesso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It also counts as a year of %@ experience." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conta anche come un anno di esperienza nel settore %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It also helps to have a senior person who speaks up for you. Many promotions are decided by people, not by rules." : {
      "comment" : "Director note, point 2: the same fact in a beginner's or child's words",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aiuta anche avere una persona esperta che parli a tuo favore. Molte promozioni le decidono le persone, non le regole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It asks %lld years in %@, and %@ of ideal applicants get the seat each year." : {
      "comment" : "Director note, point 1: what the game does about it. Arguments: required years, the job field Business, a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It asks %1$lld year in %2$@, and %3$@ of ideal applicants get the seat each year."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It asks %1$lld years in %2$@, and %3$@ of ideal applicants get the seat each year."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Richiede un anno nel settore %2$@; tra i candidati ideali, ottiene il posto ogni anno solo %3$@."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Richiede %1$lld anni nel settore %2$@; tra i candidati ideali, ottiene il posto ogni anno solo %3$@."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It asks %lld years in %@, and only %@ of ideal applicants get a C-suite seat each year." : {
      "comment" : "CTO note, point 1: what the game does about it. Arguments: required years, the job field Technology, a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It asks %1$lld year in %2$@, and only %3$@ of ideal applicants get a C-suite seat each year."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It asks %1$lld years in %2$@, and only %3$@ of ideal applicants get a C-suite seat each year."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Richiede un anno nel settore %2$@; tra i candidati ideali, ottiene un posto nell’alta dirigenza ogni anno solo %3$@."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
