      }
    },
    "Lessons on an instrument, graded exam by exam. Daily practice, and the nerve to perform what you've practised." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unterricht an einem Instrument, Prüfung für Prüfung gestuft. Tägliches Üben und der Mut, vorzuspielen, was du geübt hast."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lezioni di strumento, con livelli superati esame dopo esame. Esercizio quotidiano e il coraggio di eseguire ciò che hai provato."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Уроки гри на інструменті з екзаменами за рівнями. Щоденна практика й сміливість виступити з тим, що відпрацьовано."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let's go! 🚀" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los geht’s! 🚀"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andiamo! 🚀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets you fly planes for paid work — required to be hired by airlines and freight carriers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit darfst du gegen Bezahlung Flugzeuge fliegen – nötig, um von Fluggesellschaften und Frachtunternehmen eingestellt zu werden."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ti permette di pilotare aerei per lavoro — necessario per farsi assumere da compagnie aeree e vettori cargo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licences" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lizenzen"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abilitazioni"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licensed Practical Nurse — a state license to give basic nursing care under an RN or physician. Earned through a roughly one-year practical-nursing program and the NCLEX-PN exam. The common step up from a nursing aide toward becoming an RN." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) – eine staatliche Lizenz für die Grundpflege unter Aufsicht eines Krankenpflegers (RN) oder Arztes. Du erwirbst sie durch ein praktisches Pflegeprogramm von etwa einem Jahr und die Prüfung NCLEX-PN. Der übliche Schritt vom Pflegehelfer zum RN."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Infermiere pratico (LPN) — un’abilitazione statale per fornire assistenza infermieristica di base sotto la guida di un RN o di un medico. Si ottiene con un programma di infermieristica pratica di circa un anno e l’esame NCLEX-PN. È il passo più comune per salire da operatore socio-sanitario verso il ruolo di RN."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lights, camera, action! Performing, creating, and competing in the spotlight — acting, music, dance, film, TV, social media, and pro sports." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Licht, Kamera, Action! Im Rampenlicht auftreten, kreativ sein und sich messen – Schauspiel, Musik, Tanz, Film, Fernsehen, Social Media und Profisport."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luci, camera, azione! Esibirsi, creare e gareggiare sotto i riflettori — recitazione, musica, danza, cinema, TV, social media e sport professionistico."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Світло, камера, мотор! Виступати, творити й змагатися під софітами — акторство, музика, танці, кіно, ТБ, соцмережі та професійний спорт."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Likely jobs: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mögliche Jobs: %@."
