    "Many add management training, such as an MBA or a master's in health administration, because the job is budgets, quality and people rather than patients." : {
      "comment" : "Chief Medical Officer note, point 2 (management training): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Molti aggiungono una formazione manageriale, come un MBA o una laurea magistrale in gestione sanitaria, perché il lavoro riguarda budget, qualità e persone più che pazienti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many jobs need a certain degree before you can apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Viele Jobs verlangen einen bestimmten Abschluss, bevor du dich bewerben kannst."
