            "value" : "Середня школа"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mind" : {
      "comment" : "Kind of contest: a contest of the mind such as chess or debate",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denksport"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mentale"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "頭脳"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Інтелектуальні"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Minimum wages are set province by province, and pay in IT and finance is far above hotels and catering." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing China's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mindestlöhne werden von Provinz zu Provinz festgelegt, und die Gehälter in IT und Finanzen liegen weit über denen in Hotels und Gastronomie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I salari minimi sono fissati provincia per provincia, e gli stipendi nell’IT e nella finanza sono molto più alti che negli alberghi e nella ristorazione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最低賃金は省ごとに決まります。ITや金融の給料は、ホテルや飲食業をはるかに上回ります。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мінімальну зарплату встановлюють у кожній провінції окремо, а в ІТ і фінансах платять набагато більше, ніж у готелях і громадському харчуванні."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Money earned: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verdientes Geld: %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denaro guadagnato: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Money you borrowed for school. It grows by %@ a year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geld, das du dir für deine Ausbildung geliehen hast. Es wächst um %@ pro Jahr."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denaro che hai preso in prestito per la scuola. Cresce di %@ all’anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Money you borrowed to start a business. It grows by %@ a year until it's paid back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geld, das du dir geliehen hast, um ein Unternehmen zu gründen. Es wächst um %@ pro Jahr, bis es zurückgezahlt ist."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denaro che hai preso in prestito per avviare un’impresa. Cresce di %@ all’anno finché non lo restituisci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Months of recruit training in law, firearms, driving, and defensive tactics. No one is sworn in as an officer without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monatelange Rekrutenausbildung in Recht, Schusswaffen, Fahren und Verteidigungstaktik. Ohne sie wird niemand als Polizist vereidigt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mesi di addestramento per le reclute in legge, armi da fuoco, guida e tattiche difensive. Senza di esso nessuno presta giuramento come agente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More years help you get promoted, and some jobs only hire people with enough years in this kind of work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mehr Jahre helfen dir bei der Beförderung, und manche Jobs stellen nur Leute mit genug Jahren in dieser Art von Arbeit ein."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Più anni aiutano a ottenere una promozione, e alcuni lavori assumono solo chi ha abbastanza anni in questo tipo di lavoro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most new CEOs already worked at the company for years, running a big part of it while the bosses watched." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 2: the same fact in a beginner's or child's words",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La maggior parte dei nuovi CEO lavorava già in azienda da anni, guidandone una grossa parte sotto gli occhi dei capi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most new CEOs come from inside the company. They typically spent years running a division with its own profit and loss, or served as COO or CFO, while the board watched." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 2 (CEOs are inside hires): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La maggior parte dei nuovi CEO arriva dall’interno dell’azienda. Di solito ha passato anni a guidare una divisione con un proprio conto economico, oppure ha fatto il COO o il CFO, sotto gli occhi del consiglio di amministrazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Most pay is far below western Europe, but IT pays well above the national average — the best-paid path in the country." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Ukraine's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die meisten Gehälter liegen weit unter Westeuropa, aber IT zahlt deutlich über dem Landesdurchschnitt – der bestbezahlte Weg im Land."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quasi tutti gli stipendi sono molto più bassi che nell’Europa occidentale, ma il settore IT paga ben sopra la media nazionale — è il percorso meglio pagato del paese."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ほとんどの仕事の給料は西ヨーロッパをはるかに下回りますが、ITは全国平均を大きく上回ります。国内でいちばん稼げる道です。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Більшість зарплат набагато нижчі, ніж у Західній Європі, але в ІТ платять значно більше за середню по країні зарплату — це найвигідніший шлях."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move people and goods by road and air: drive, fly, operate, keep vehicles running safely, and plan the routes and warehouses behind it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menschen und Waren auf Straße und in der Luft bewegen: fahren, fliegen, bedienen, Fahrzeuge sicher am Laufen halten und die Routen und Lager dahinter planen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sposta persone e merci su strada e per via aerea: guida, vola, manovra, mantieni i veicoli in funzione in sicurezza e pianifica i percorsi e i magazzini che stanno dietro a tutto."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Перевозь людей і вантажі дорогами та повітрям: води, літай, керуй технікою, стеж, щоб транспорт був справним і безпечним, та плануй маршрути й склади, що за цим стоять."
          }
        }
      }
    },
