          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Medagliato olimpico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once you have it, it's the biggest help there is — %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sobald du ihn hast, ist er die größte Hilfe überhaupt – %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando ce l’hai, è l’aiuto più grande che esista — %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once you've tried a couple of different things, I'll suggest jobs that fit you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando avrai provato un paio di cose diverse, ti suggerirò lavori adatti a te."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One move a year — %@ — closes the whole gap in about %lld years." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "One move a year — %1$@ — closes the whole gap in about %2$lld year."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "One move a year — %1$@ — closes the whole gap in about %2$lld years."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Una mossa all’anno — %1$@ — colma tutto il divario in circa un anno."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Una mossa all’anno — %1$@ — colma tutto il divario in circa %2$lld anni."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One move a year — %@ — closes the whole gap in more than a decade." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una mossa all’anno — %@ — colma tutto il divario in più di dieci anni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the very best schools. Very hard to get into — but it gives your career a big boost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine der allerbesten Hochschulen. Sehr schwer, hineinzukommen – aber sie gibt deiner Karriere einen großen Schub."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una delle migliori scuole in assoluto. È molto difficile entrare — ma dà una grande spinta alla tua carriera."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Один із найкращих закладів. Вступити дуже важко, але це сильно підштовхне твою карʼєру."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One photo, one theme, judged by the local paper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una foto, un tema e la giuria del giornale locale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One piece, a full hall, and your family in the front row." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un solo brano, una sala gremita e la tua famiglia in prima fila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One prompt, the country's strongest student writers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Thema, die besten jungen Schreiber des Landes."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una sola traccia e i migliori giovani scrittori del paese."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "お題は1つ。国内でいちばん文章が上手な生徒たちが競います。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Одна тема, найсильніші юні автори країни."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One skill-building credential covering %@ adds up to +%@ to your chance. It isn't required, and they don't stack." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "One skill-building credential covering %1$@ adds up to +%2$@ to your chance. It isn't required, and they don't stack."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una qualifica che sviluppa competenze nel settore %1$@ aggiunge fino a +%2$@ alla tua probabilità. Non è obbligatoria, e più qualifiche non si sommano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One to two more years of focused study after a Bachelor. Opens up senior roles and research careers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein bis zwei weitere Jahre konzentriertes Studium nach dem Bachelor. Öffnet die Tür zu höheren Positionen und zu Forschungskarrieren."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da uno a due anni di studio mirato dopo la laurea triennale. Apre le porte a ruoli di alto livello e a carriere nella ricerca."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ще від одного до двох років поглибленого навчання після бакалавра. Відкриває двері до вищих посад і наукової карʼєри."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One turn = one year" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Runde = ein Jahr"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un turno = un anno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One word at a time, on stage, until one speller is left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wort für Wort auf der Bühne, bis nur noch ein Teilnehmer übrig ist."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una parola alla volta, sul palco, finché non rimane un solo concorrente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ステージで1語ずつつづり、最後の1人になるまで続きます。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "По одному слову на сцені, поки не залишиться лише один учасник."
          }
        }
      }
    },
