            "value" : "Спрощений"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Simplified mode has no school bills, so nobody has to borrow." : {
      "comment" : "Health specialist note, point 4a: what the Simplified tutorial mode does instead\nHealth specialist note, point 4b: what the Simplified tutorial mode does instead",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La modalità Semplificata non ha tasse d’iscrizione, quindi nessuno deve prendere soldi in prestito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Simplified mode skips the licence: years of work open each step up (%@)." : {
      "comment" : "Airline pilot note, point 1: what the Simplified tutorial mode does instead. The argument is a list of years of work, e.g. '0, 3 and 8'",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La modalità Semplificata salta il brevetto: gli anni di lavoro aprono ogni passo avanti (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Singles or doubles tennis. A racket sport that drills focus, footwork, and composure in long points." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tennis im Einzel oder Doppel. Ein Schlägersport, der Konzentration, Beinarbeit und Gelassenheit in langen Ballwechseln trainiert."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tennis singolo o doppio. Uno sport con la racchetta che allena concentrazione, gioco di gambe e sangue freddo negli scambi lunghi."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Теніс в одиночному чи парному розряді. Ракетний спорт, що тренує зосередженість, роботу ніг і витримку в довгих розіграшах."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Six problems over two days against the world's best school students." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sechs Aufgaben an zwei Tagen gegen die besten Schüler der Welt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sei problemi in due giorni contro i migliori studenti delle scuole di tutto il mondo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2日間で6問。世界トップクラスの生徒たちと競います。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Шість задач за два дні проти найкращих школярів світу."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skateboarding & BMX" : {
      "comment" : "Sport",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skateboard & BMX"
          }
        },
