    "Thanks!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Danke!"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Grazie!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the founder track record: it lifts the seat from %@ to at most %@. It eases the odds; it never decides them." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 4: what the game does about it. Arguments: two percentages",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That's the founder track record: it lifts the seat from %1$@ to at most %2$@. It eases the odds; it never decides them."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È il curriculum da fondatore: porta la probabilità di ottenere il posto da %1$@ a, al massimo, %2$@. Dà una mano, ma non decide mai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the seat. Only %@ of otherwise-ideal applicants get a C-suite job in any year." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 1: what the game does about it. The argument is a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È il posto al vertice: tra i candidati altrimenti ideali, in un anno qualsiasi ottiene un lavoro nell’alta dirigenza solo %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's why the seat is %@, not %@." : {
      "comment" : "Director note, point 3: what the game does about it. Arguments: the director seat chance, the C-suite seat chance, both percentages",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That's why the seat is %1$@, not %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per questo la probabilità del posto è %1$@ e non %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ industry is in a slump, so employers are hiring less. Keep building skills and try again when it recovers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il settore %@ è in crisi, quindi i datori di lavoro assumono meno. Continua a sviluppare le tue competenze e riprova quando si riprende."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ is the door." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La porta d’ingresso è: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ job (%@ a year) needs %@ %lld. You're at %lld." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The %1$@ job (%2$@ a year) needs %3$@ %4$lld. You're at %5$lld."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il ruolo di %1$@ (%2$@ all’anno) richiede la competenza %3$@ a quota %4$lld. Tu sei a %5$lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ title opens the door — and in Simplified mode, once you have it, a team spot is yours." : {
      "comment" : "Professional athlete note, point 1: what the Simplified tutorial mode does instead. The argument is the name of a junior championship title",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il titolo «%@» apre la porta — e in modalità Semplificata, una volta ottenuto, un posto in squadra è tuo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ title opens the door, and even then only %@ of title-holders make a roster." : {
      "comment" : "Professional athlete note, point 1: what the game does about it. Arguments: the name of a junior championship title, a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The %1$@ title opens the door, and even then only %2$@ of title-holders make a roster."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il titolo «%1$@» apre la porta, e anche così la quota di chi lo detiene ed entra in una squadra è pari a %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Chopin, the Tchaikovsky — a win makes a career." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il Chopin, il Čajkovskij — una vittoria costruisce una carriera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Delhi minimum wage (₹18,456 a month)" : {
      "comment" : "Noun phrase naming the minimum-wage rule in India. It leads the picker line \"<this>: no job pays under <amount> a year.\"",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
