            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo spettacolo di fine anno — un solo assolo si aggiudica il premio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The federal minimum wage" : {
      "comment" : "Noun phrase naming the minimum-wage rule in United States. It leads the picker line \"<this>: no job pays under <amount> a year.\"",
      "localizations" : {
