    "The minimum wage is about 60% of the typical full-time wage." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing South Korea's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Mindestlohn beträgt etwa 60 % des üblichen Vollzeitgehalts."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salario minimo è circa il 60% dello stipendio tipico a tempo pieno."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最低賃金は、ふつうのフルタイムの賃金のおよそ60%です。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мінімальна зарплата становить близько 60% типової зарплати за повну зайнятість."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The minimum wage is paid in 13 instalments, and the average worker earns about 2.3 times the minimum." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Brazil's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Mindestlohn wird 13-mal im Jahr gezahlt, und der durchschnittliche Arbeitnehmer verdient etwa das 2,3-Fache des Mindestlohns."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salario minimo è pagato in 13 mensilità, e di media si guadagna circa 2,3 volte il minimo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最低賃金は13回に分けて支払われ、平均的な労働者の収入は最低賃金のおよそ2.3倍です。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мінімальну зарплату виплачують 13 разів на рік, а середній працівник заробляє приблизно у 2,3 раза більше за мінімум."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The minimum wage is paid in 14 instalments, and pay is low next to the rest of western Europe." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Spain's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Mindestlohn wird 14-mal im Jahr gezahlt, und die Gehälter sind niedrig im Vergleich zum Rest Westeuropas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salario minimo è pagato in 14 mensilità, e gli stipendi sono bassi rispetto al resto dell’Europa occidentale."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最低賃金は14回に分けて支払われ、給料は西ヨーロッパのほかの国々と比べて低めです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Мінімальну зарплату виплачують 14 разів на рік, а зарплати низькі порівняно з рештою Західної Європи."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money goes into the company, not your pocket. Your share of the company becomes worth ×%@, the business can pay you %@ more, and you get more famous in business. To turn it into money, sell your share. If investors say no, you only lose the year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Geld fließt ins Unternehmen, nicht in deine Tasche. Dein Anteil am Unternehmen wird das %1$@-Fache wert, das Geschäft kann dir %2$@ mehr zahlen und dein Ruhm in Wirtschaft wächst. Um daraus Geld zu machen, verkaufe deinen Anteil. Wenn die Investoren ablehnen, verlierst du nur das Jahr."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The money goes into the company, not your pocket. Your share of the company becomes worth ×%1$@, the business can pay you %2$@ more, and you get more famous in business. To turn it into money, sell your share. If investors say no, you only lose the year."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I soldi vanno all’azienda, non nelle tue tasche. La tua quota dell’azienda arriva a valere ×%1$@, l’impresa può pagarti %2$@ in più e la tua fama nel settore Business cresce. Per trasformarla in denaro, vendi la tua quota. Se gli investitori dicono di no, perdi solo l’anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money you've saved. It grows by about %@ a year while it's above zero — but it can drop in a year when the economy turns bad." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Geld, das du gespart hast. Es wächst um etwa %@ pro Jahr, solange es über null liegt – kann aber in einem Jahr sinken, in dem die Konjunktur schwächelt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il denaro che hai messo da parte. Cresce di circa %@ all’anno finché è sopra lo zero — ma può calare in un anno in cui l’economia va male."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more %@ %@ fame you have, the more they pay, every year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je mehr Ruhm in %1$@ %2$@ du hast, desto mehr zahlen sie – jedes Jahr."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The more %1$@ %2$@ fame you have, the more they pay, every year."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Più fama hai nel settore %1$@ %2$@, più pagano, ogni anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more you ask, the fewer buyers: at %@ there's about a %@ chance someone buys this year — fewer buyers than usual, because the economy is doing badly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je mehr du verlangst, desto weniger Käufer: Bei %1$@ liegt die Chance, dass dieses Jahr jemand kauft, bei etwa %2$@ – weniger Käufer als sonst, weil die Konjunktur schwach ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The more you ask, the fewer buyers: at %1$@ there's about a %2$@ chance someone buys this year — fewer buyers than usual, because the economy is doing badly."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Più chiedi, meno acquirenti ci sono: a %1$@ la probabilità che qualcuno compri quest’anno è di circa %2$@ — meno acquirenti del solito, perché l’economia va male."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The more you ask, the fewer buyers: at %@ there's about a %@ chance someone buys this year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je mehr du verlangst, desto weniger Käufer: Bei %1$@ liegt die Chance, dass dieses Jahr jemand kauft, bei etwa %2$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The more you ask, the fewer buyers: at %1$@ there's about a %2$@ chance someone buys this year."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Più chiedi, meno acquirenti ci sono: a %1$@ la probabilità che qualcuno compri quest’anno è di circa %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The national under-18 title." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der nationale U18-Titel."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il titolo nazionale under 18."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "18歳未満の全国タイトルです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Національний титул серед гравців до 18 років."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The newest one is shown here. Open it to see them all, newest first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der neueste wird hier gezeigt. Öffne ihn, um alle zu sehen, den neuesten zuerst."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qui vedi il più recente. Aprilo per vederli tutti, dal più recente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number on the right is what you own minus what you owe. Divide it by your age and you get your score — tap Score at the top to see it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Zahl rechts ist das, was du besitzt, minus das, was du schuldest. Teile sie durch dein Alter, dann hast du deine Punktzahl – tippe oben auf „Punktzahl“, um sie zu sehen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il numero a destra è ciò che possiedi meno ciò che devi. Dividilo per la tua età e ottieni il tuo punteggio — tocca Punteggio in alto per vederlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The other door is to build a company yourself. A founder doesn't wait to be picked, though most start-ups fail. Boards like people who have run a business, even one that failed — yet most new big-company CEOs had never been a CEO before." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 4 (founders): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’altra porta è costruire un’azienda da sé. Chi fonda un’azienda non aspetta la scelta di altri, anche se la maggior parte delle startup fallisce. I consigli di amministrazione apprezzano chi ha gestito un’attività, anche se è fallita — eppure la maggior parte dei nuovi CEO delle grandi aziende non lo era mai stata prima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The people who move things around by truck, train, ship and plane." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Leute, die Dinge per Lkw, Zug, Schiff und Flugzeug transportieren."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le persone che spostano le cose in camion, treno, nave e aereo."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ті, хто перевозить вантажі вантажівками, потягами, кораблями та літаками."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The premier athletic title — the country is watching. Only for seasoned competitors." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il massimo titolo sportivo — tutto il Paese ti guarda. Solo per competitori esperti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The prize critics write about." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il premio di cui scrivono i critici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest" : {
      "comment" : "Title of an advisor card that lists the remaining, minor levers on a hire chance in one line each",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il resto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The retail pay floor (26,626 kr a month, no legal minimum)" : {
      "comment" : "Noun phrase naming the minimum-wage rule in Sweden. It leads the picker line \"<this>: no job pays under <amount> a year.\"",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Gehaltsuntergrenze im Einzelhandel (26.626 kr pro Monat, kein gesetzlicher Mindestlohn)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il minimo salariale della vendita al dettaglio (26.626 kr al mese, nessun minimo per legge)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小売業の給料の下限（月額26,626 kr、法定の最低賃金はありません）"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нижня межа зарплат у роздрібній торгівлі (26 626 kr на місяць, законодавчого мінімуму немає)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The road is long and every step is selective: a bachelor's degree, then a professional or doctoral programme that admits well under half of its applicants, then — for doctors — three to seven years of supervised hospital training before you practise alone." : {
      "comment" : "Health specialist note, point 1 (a long, selective road): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La strada è lunga e ogni tappa è selettiva: una laurea triennale, poi un programma professionale o di dottorato che ammette ben meno della metà dei candidati, poi — per i medici — 3–7 anni di formazione in ospedale sotto supervisione prima di poter esercitare in autonomia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The school accepted you onto %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Schule hat dich für %@ angenommen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai ottenuto l’ammissione al percorso %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The school cares about: grades %@, skills %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Schule achtet auf: Noten %1$@, Fähigkeiten %2$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The school cares about: grades %1$@, skills %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La scuola valuta: voti %1$@, competenze %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The school said no this time — you had a %@ chance. You can try again next year!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Schule hat diesmal abgelehnt – du hattest eine Chance von %@. Nächstes Jahr kannst du es noch einmal versuchen!"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa volta la scuola ha detto di no — la probabilità era pari a %@. Puoi riprovare l’anno prossimo!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The seat" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a lever in the career advisor: the scarce top position (a board seat, a partnership) that only a small share of qualified people win each year",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il posto al vertice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The senior electrician license. Earned after years as a licensed journeyman, it lets you pull permits, run jobs, and supervise apprentices — required to become a Master Electrician." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die höhere Elektriker-Lizenz. Du erwirbst sie nach Jahren als Geselle mit Lizenz. Damit darfst du Genehmigungen einholen, Aufträge leiten und Auszubildende anleiten – nötig, um Elektromeister zu werden."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’abilitazione da elettricista di livello più alto. Si ottiene dopo anni da elettricista qualificato e permette di richiedere i permessi, gestire i lavori e supervisionare gli apprendisti — è necessaria per diventare Maestro elettricista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The senior plumbing license. Earned after journeyman experience, it lets you design systems, pull permits, and lead a crew — required to become a Master Plumber." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die höhere Klempner-Lizenz. Du erwirbst sie nach Erfahrung als Geselle. Damit darfst du Anlagen planen, Genehmigungen einholen und ein Team leiten – nötig, um Klempnermeister zu werden."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’abilitazione da idraulico di livello più alto. Si ottiene dopo l’esperienza da idraulico qualificato e permette di progettare impianti, richiedere i permessi e guidare una squadra — è necessaria per diventare Maestro idraulico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The state student loan charges less than inflation, so its real cost is nothing." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Poland's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Zinsen des staatlichen Studienkredits liegen unter der Inflation, die realen Kosten sind also null."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il prestito studentesco statale ha un tasso inferiore all’inflazione, quindi il suo costo reale è nullo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "国の奨学金の利子はインフレ率より低いため、実質的な負担はありません。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Відсотки за державним студентським кредитом нижчі за інфляцію, тож реально він нічого не коштує."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The step up to serious competition — qualify against your region's best. Years of training required." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il salto verso la competizione seria — qualificati contro i migliori della tua regione. Servono anni di allenamento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tech world's big yearly meetup — talks on new apps, gadgets and ideas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das große jährliche Treffen der Tech-Welt – Vorträge über neue Apps, Gadgets und Ideen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il grande incontro annuale del mondo tech — interventi su nuove app, gadget e idee."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Велика щорічна зустріч світу технологій — доповіді про нові застосунки, гаджети та ідеї."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title the companies scout at." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il titolo che le compagnie di danza tengono d’occhio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The top national universities cost less than most private ones; private medical schools cost millions of yen a year." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Japan's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die besten staatlichen Universitäten kosten weniger als die meisten privaten; private medizinische Fakultäten kosten Millionen Yen pro Jahr."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le migliori università nazionali costano meno della maggior parte di quelle private; le facoltà di medicina private costano milioni di yen all’anno."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "トップ級の国立大学は、多くの私立大学より学費が安くなります。私立の医学部は1年に数百万円かかります。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Провідні національні університети коштують дешевше за більшість приватних; приватні медичні заклади коштують мільйони єн на рік."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The world stage. Medal here and you're a household name for life — the summit of a long career." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il palcoscenico mondiale. Vinci una medaglia qui e il tuo nome lo conoscono tutti per sempre — la vetta di una lunga carriera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The world's best teams on one stage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die besten Teams der Welt auf einer Bühne."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I migliori team del mondo su un unico palco."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "世界の強豪チームが、ひとつの舞台に集まります。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Найкращі команди світу на одній сцені."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The world's largest pre-college science competition." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der weltweit größte Wissenschaftswettbewerb für Schüler."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La più grande gara scientifica del mondo prima dell’università."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大学入学前の生徒を対象にした、世界最大の科学コンテストです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Найбільше у світі наукове змагання для школярів."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The year's best images, printed large and toured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le migliori immagini dell’anno, stampate in grande formato ed esposte in tournée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The youth league final — where scouts spot the next generation of pro players." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La finale del campionato giovanile — dove i talent scout scoprono la prossima generazione di professionisti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The “%@” title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il titolo «%@»"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then you'll have about a %@ chance each year to move up and earn about %@ a year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Then you'll have about a %1$@ chance each year to move up and earn about %2$@ a year."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poi, ogni anno, avrai una probabilità pari a %1$@ di avanzare e di guadagnare circa %2$@ all’anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then: %@ (%lld more years)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Then: %1$@ (%2$lld more year)."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Then: %1$@ (%2$lld more years)."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Poi: %1$@ (ancora un anno)."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Poi: %1$@ (ancora %2$lld anni)."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no companies to start in Simplified mode — you climb by working." : {
      "comment" : "Advisor real-world note, tutorial (Simplified mode): founding a company is not possible there",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In modalità Semplificata non si possono avviare aziende — si sale di livello lavorando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are only a few hundred CEO jobs at the biggest companies, and a board's search can run for a year." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 1 (scarcity of CEO jobs): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nelle aziende più grandi ci sono solo poche centinaia di posti da CEO, e la ricerca da parte di un consiglio di amministrazione può durare un anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There aren't many %@ jobs — only %@ of the people who are ready get one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt nicht viele Jobs als %1$@ – nur %2$@ der Leute, die bereit sind, bekommen einen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "There aren't many %1$@ jobs — only %2$@ of the people who are ready get one."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I lavori da %1$@ sono pochi — solo %2$@ di chi ha i requisiti ne ottiene uno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no legal minimum wage: union agreements set the floor, retail's among them." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Sweden's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt keinen gesetzlichen Mindestlohn: Tarifverträge der Gewerkschaften legen die Untergrenze fest, auch im Einzelhandel."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non esiste un salario minimo per legge: il minimo lo fissano gli accordi sindacali, tra cui quello della vendita al dettaglio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "法定の最低賃金はなく、労働組合との協約が下限を決めます。小売業もそのひとつです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Законодавчої мінімальної зарплати немає: нижню межу задають угоди з профспілками, зокрема й у роздрібній торгівлі."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no single minimum wage: each state sets its own, and most workers earn little." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing India's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es gibt keinen einheitlichen Mindestlohn: Jeder Bundesstaat legt seinen eigenen fest, und die meisten Arbeitnehmer verdienen wenig."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non esiste un unico salario minimo: ogni stato fissa il proprio, e la maggior parte dei lavoratori guadagna poco."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全国共通の最低賃金はなく、州ごとに決まります。ほとんどの労働者の収入は少なめです。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Єдиної мінімальної зарплати немає: кожен штат встановлює свою, а більшість працівників заробляє мало."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no higher job to be promoted to from here. Your pay still goes up a little each year, up to a limit. To earn more, apply for a bigger job." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Von hier aus gibt es keinen höheren Job mehr, zu dem du befördert werden kannst. Dein Gehalt steigt trotzdem jedes Jahr ein wenig, bis zu einer Grenze. Um mehr zu verdienen, bewirb dich auf einen größeren Job."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Da qui non c’è nessun lavoro più alto a cui puntare con una promozione. Il tuo stipendio sale comunque un po’ ogni anno, fino a un limite. Per guadagnare di più, candidati a un lavoro più importante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no luck to worry about here: once you have the right school and enough years of work, the job is yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Qui non devi preoccuparti della fortuna: quando hai la scuola giusta e abbastanza anni di lavoro, il lavoro è tuo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's nothing to plan on this one yet — just keep going with school, activities and trying new things." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per ora su questo non c’è nulla da pianificare — continua con la scuola, le attività e le cose nuove da provare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These firms recruit mostly from a short list of universities, through campus events and internships. At the biggest banks, well under %@ of applicants for analyst jobs are hired." : {
      "comment" : "Elite firm note, point 1 (campus recruiting): the real-world claim, for adults. General claim (the sources are American, the claim is stated for everyone). The argument is a percentage",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Queste società assumono soprattutto da un breve elenco di università, tramite eventi nei campus e tirocini. Nelle banche più grandi, ben meno di %@ dei candidati a posti da analista ottiene il lavoro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These jobs ask for more of skills like %@, %@ and %@ than most." : {
      "comment" : "Health specialist note, point 3: what the game does about it. The arguments are the names of three of the game's skills",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "These jobs ask for more of skills like %1$@, %2$@ and %3$@ than most."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questi lavori richiedono competenze come %1$@, %2$@ e %3$@ più degli altri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ich denke nach…"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sto pensando…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirty tricky puzzles, one morning, millions of kids worldwide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dreißig knifflige Aufgaben, ein Vormittag, Millionen Kinder weltweit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trenta rompicapo insidiosi, una mattina, milioni di ragazzi in tutto il mondo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "頭をひねるパズルが30問。1回の午前中に、世界中の数百万人の子どもが挑戦します。"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Тридцять підступних задач, один ранок, мільйони дітей у всьому світі."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This career has a special door: you need the “%@” title first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Karriere hat eine besondere Tür: Du brauchst zuerst den Titel „%@“."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa carriera ha un ingresso speciale: prima ti serve il titolo «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device can't run Apple Intelligence, so you'll get the advisor's standard advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo dispositivo non può usare Apple Intelligence, quindi avrai i consigli di base del consulente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the first step toward the %@ job (%@). It's about %lld years of school in total." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
