    "Tuition is moderate, and the federal part of a student loan is interest-free." : {
      "comment" : "Info bullet in the country picker describing Canada's pay and school costs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Studiengebühren sind moderat, und der Bundesanteil eines Studienkredits ist zinsfrei."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le tasse d’iscrizione sono moderate, e la parte federale di un prestito studentesco è senza interessi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授業料はほどほどで、奨学金のうち連邦政府の分は無利子です。"
