    "Years of experience" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a lever on the player's hire chance in the career advisor",
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anni di esperienza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Years open the door: %lld years in %@, and nothing under about %@. Any %@ job counts, and so do years running your own company." : {
      "comment" : "CEO note, point 2: what the game does about it. Arguments: required years, the job field Business (twice), the minimum years that still count",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Years open the door: %1$lld year in %2$@, and nothing under about %3$@. Any %4$@ job counts, and so do years running your own company."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Years open the door: %1$lld years in %2$@, and nothing under about %3$@. Any %4$@ job counts, and so do years running your own company."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Gli anni aprono la porta: un anno nel settore %2$@, e nulla sotto circa %3$@. Conta qualsiasi lavoro nel settore %4$@, così come gli anni passati a gestire una tua azienda."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Gli anni aprono la porta: %1$lld anni nel settore %2$@, e nulla sotto circa %3$@. Conta qualsiasi lavoro nel settore %4$@, così come gli anni passati a gestire una tua azienda."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Years running your own business count too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contano anche gli anni passati a gestire un’attività in proprio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have every skill %@ needs. 🎉 That helps your promotion chances as much as it can." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast schon alle Fähigkeiten, die der Job als %@ verlangt. 🎉 Das verbessert deine Beförderungschancen so sehr, wie es nur geht."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai già tutte le competenze che servono per %@. 🎉 Questo aiuta le tue probabilità di promozione al massimo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can apply as soon as you've finished the school level above. After that, your chance goes up with:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst dich bewerben, sobald du die Schulstufe oben abgeschlossen hast. Danach steigt deine Chance durch:"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi candidarti non appena hai finito il livello scolastico qui sopra. Dopo, la tua probabilità sale con:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can apply for %@ now — a %@ chance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You can apply for %1$@ now — a %2$@ chance."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi candidarti subito come %1$@ — la probabilità è pari a %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can apply for %@ now!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi candidarti subito come %@!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can apply for it now!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi candidarti subito!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can get this job! It pays %@ a year — %@ more than you earn now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You can get this job! It pays %1$@ a year — %2$@ more than you earn now."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi ottenere questo lavoro! Lo stipendio è di %1$@ all’anno — %2$@ in più di quanto guadagni ora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can get this job! It pays %@ a year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puoi ottenere questo lavoro! Lo stipendio è di %@ all’anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't be hired for it yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per ora non puoi ottenerlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't be promoted to %@ yet — you need what it asks for and enough years in this job first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst noch nicht zu „%@“ befördert werden – dafür brauchst du erst, was verlangt wird, und genug Jahre in diesem Job."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non puoi ancora ottenere una promozione a %@ — prima ti servono i requisiti richiesti e abbastanza anni in questo lavoro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't get this job yet. First you need: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst diesen Job noch nicht bekommen. Du brauchst noch: %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non puoi ancora ottenere questo lavoro. Prima devi avere: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You climbed all the way to the top — you're now %@! 👔" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist ganz nach oben aufgestiegen – jetzt arbeitest du als %@! 👔"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai scalato la carriera fino in cima — ora ricopri il ruolo di %@! 👔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You climbed all the way to the top — you're now in a top leadership role! 👔" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist ganz nach oben aufgestiegen – jetzt hast du eine Top-Führungsrolle! 👔"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai scalato la carriera fino in cima — ora ricopri un ruolo di alta dirigenza! 👔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You could apply for %@ now, but it's a long shot (%@) — and an application spends the year. Lift your chances first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You could apply for %1$@ now, but it's a long shot (%2$@) — and an application spends the year. Lift your chances first."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Potresti candidarti subito come %1$@, ma è un tentativo difficile (%2$@) — e una candidatura ti costa un anno. Prima aumenta le tue probabilità."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You could apply for %@ — but there are no postings this year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Potresti candidarti come %@ — ma quest’anno non ci sono annunci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You didn't practise anything last year. This year, try %@ — it builds %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You didn't practise anything last year. This year, try %1$@ — it builds %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’anno scorso non hai praticato nessuna attività. Quest’anno prova %1$@ — sviluppa %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have school grades yet, so the game guesses them from your skills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast noch keine Schulnoten, deshalb schätzt das Spiel sie aus deinen Fähigkeiten."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non hai ancora voti scolastici, quindi il gioco li stima in base alle tue competenze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't pay it back while you're studying — after that, payments come out of your savings and pay each year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solange du studierst, zahlst du nichts zurück – danach kommen die Zahlungen jedes Jahr aus deinen Ersparnissen und deinem Gehalt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non lo restituisci mentre studi — dopo, i pagamenti vengono presi dai tuoi risparmi e dallo stipendio di ogni anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't strictly need it — but it helps every time you apply and every time you could be promoted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du brauchst sie nicht unbedingt – aber sie hilft bei jeder Bewerbung und bei jeder möglichen Beförderung."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non è strettamente necessaria — ma aiuta ogni volta che ti candidi e ogni volta che puoi ottenere una promozione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You get famous by winning contests, speaking at events, projects that work out and running your own company. Fame makes it easier to get hired and promoted in that field — and brands pay very famous entertainers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du wirst berühmt durch gewonnene Wettbewerbe, Auftritte bei Events, Projekte, die klappen, und ein eigenes Unternehmen. Ruhm macht es leichter, in diesem Bereich eingestellt und befördert zu werden – und Marken bezahlen sehr berühmte Entertainer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si ottiene fama vincendo gare, intervenendo a eventi, portando a termine progetti che funzionano e gestendo una propria azienda. La fama rende più facile ottenere un lavoro e una promozione in quel settore — e i marchi pagano molto gli artisti più famosi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You had a %@ chance, and this time it didn't work out. Don't give up — try again next year!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hattest eine Chance von %@, und diesmal hat es nicht geklappt. Gib nicht auf – versuch es nächstes Jahr noch einmal!"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La probabilità era pari a %@, e questa volta non è andata. Non arrenderti — riprova l’anno prossimo!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have a %@ chance to get it. It pays %@ — %@ more than you earn now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You have a %1$@ chance to get it. It pays %2$@ — %3$@ more than you earn now."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La probabilità di ottenerlo è pari a %1$@. Lo stipendio è di %2$@ — %3$@ in più di quanto guadagni ora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have a %@ chance to get it. It pays %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You have a %1$@ chance to get it. It pays %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La probabilità di ottenerlo è pari a %1$@. Lo stipendio è di %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have a %@ chance to move up this year. You'd earn about %@ a year." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You have a %1$@ chance to move up this year. You'd earn about %2$@ a year."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quest’anno la probabilità di avanzare è pari a %1$@. Guadagneresti circa %2$@ all’anno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have it! This is the biggest help there is for getting signed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast ihn! Das ist die größte Hilfe überhaupt, um unter Vertrag genommen zu werden."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce l’hai! È il più grande aiuto possibile per ottenere un ingaggio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have to be %@ for this job — %lld more years." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "You have to be %1$@ for this job — %2$lld more year."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "You have to be %1$@ for this job — %2$lld more years."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Per questo lavoro devi avere %1$@ anni — ancora un anno."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Per questo lavoro devi avere %1$@ anni — ancora %2$lld anni."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn about movement, training, and health to improve athletic performance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst etwas über Bewegung, Training und Gesundheit, um sportliche Leistungen zu verbessern."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari movimento, allenamento e salute per migliorare le prestazioni atletiche."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вивчаєш рух, тренування й здоровʼя, щоб покращувати спортивні результати."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn coding, systems, and security to build software and manage data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst Programmieren, Systeme und Sicherheit, um Software zu entwickeln und Daten zu verwalten."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari programmazione, sistemi e sicurezza per creare software e gestire dati."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вивчаєш програмування, системи та безпеку, щоб створювати програмне забезпечення й керувати даними."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn how money, teams, and products work together to make a business succeed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst, wie Geld, Teams und Produkte zusammenwirken, damit ein Unternehmen Erfolg hat."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari come denaro, team e prodotti lavorano insieme per far riuscire un’azienda."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти дізнаєшся, як гроші, команди й продукти працюють разом, щоб бізнес мав успіх."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn how people learn, and how to teach different subjects to students." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst, wie Menschen lernen und wie du Schülern verschiedene Fächer beibringst."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari come apprendono le persone e come insegnare materie diverse agli studenti."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти дізнаєшся, як люди вчаться, і як викладати різні предмети учням."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn how the body works and how to care for people in clinics and hospitals." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst, wie der Körper funktioniert und wie du Menschen in Praxen und Krankenhäusern versorgst."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari come funziona il corpo e come prenderti cura delle persone in ambulatori e ospedali."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти дізнаєшся, як працює тіло і як доглядати за людьми в клініках і лікарнях."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn how to grow crops, care for animals, and manage farms sustainably." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst, Pflanzen anzubauen, Tiere zu versorgen und Höfe nachhaltig zu führen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari a coltivare i campi, a prenderti cura degli animali e a gestire le aziende agricole in modo sostenibile."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вчишся вирощувати культури, доглядати за тваринами й керувати фермами з турботою про довкілля."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn math, science, and design to make machines, bridges, and technologies work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst Mathematik, Naturwissenschaften und Konstruktion, damit Maschinen, Brücken und Technologien funktionieren."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari matematica, scienze e progettazione per far funzionare macchine, ponti e tecnologie."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вивчаєш математику, природничі науки й проєктування, щоб машини, мости й технології працювали."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn practical skills to support people in daily life and at work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst praktische Fähigkeiten, um Menschen im Alltag und bei der Arbeit zu unterstützen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari competenze pratiche per aiutare le persone nella vita quotidiana e al lavoro."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти опановуєш практичні навички, щоб підтримувати людей у повсякденному житті та на роботі."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn rules, rights, and justice systems to help people follow the law." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst Regeln, Rechte und das Rechtssystem kennen, damit Menschen sich ans Gesetz halten."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari le regole, i diritti e i sistemi di giustizia per aiutare le persone a rispettare la legge."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вивчаєш правила, права та системи правосуддя, щоб допомагати людям дотримуватися закону."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn to ask questions, test ideas, and discover new knowledge about nature and the universe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst, Fragen zu stellen, Ideen zu testen und neues Wissen über die Natur und das Universum zu entdecken."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari a fare domande, mettere alla prova le idee e scoprire nuove conoscenze sulla natura e sull’universo."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вчишся ставити запитання, перевіряти ідеї та відкривати нові знання про природу й Всесвіт."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You learn to plan how things look and work so they’re easy and fun to use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du lernst zu planen, wie Dinge aussehen und funktionieren, damit sie einfach zu bedienen sind und Spaß machen."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impari a progettare l’aspetto e il funzionamento delle cose perché siano facili e divertenti da usare."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ти вчишся продумувати, як речі виглядають і працюють, щоб користуватися ними було легко й цікаво."
          }
        }
      }
    },
